    q("Which sentence correctly formats 'O'Clock'?", "The train departs at six o'clock.", "The train departs at six oclock.", "The train departs at six o,clock.", "The train departs at six 'oclock.", "'o'clock' uses an apostrophe after 'o' ('of the clock')."),
